---
import { whyCards } from '@/lib/features';
---

<section id="why" class="border-b border-border py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="mono-label">Why bundant</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        The platform is the overhead.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
        A single host already gives you a network, a proxy and a restart policy. bundant adds
        the deploy discipline without asking you to run a cluster to get it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {whyCards.map((card, index) => (
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-accent-foreground">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">{card.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[0.9375rem] font-medium text-foreground">{card.body}</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">{card.detail}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
